===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*lewk-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|lunatik}}, from {{der|en|fro|lunatique}}, from {{der|en|LL.|lunaticus|t=moonstruck}}, derived from {{der|en|la|luna|t=moon}}, the connection stemming from the belief that changes of the moon caused intermittent insanity.

